Notice to officers of VENNHOLT PARTNERS LLP

From 1 January 2027 the following fees change:

- Confirmation statement (online): £13 to £15
- Confirmation statement (paper): £40 to £62
- Change of registered name: £20 to £30

Fees for filings submitted before 1 January are unaffected. The full schedule is published in the Registry Gazette, issue 44.

No action is required.

